      "description": "Delivered 2px amber border and offset 1px outline; rows stack 14px apart. Static structure; canvas edge grain is described in DESIGN.md.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-need\"><span class=\"ds-need-kind\">Question</span><span>Which option should this lane use?</span><button class=\"ds-answer\">Answer in thread</button></div>",
